# Trusted Bash configuration, read by the root-owned service. Keep this file private.
# Default state and pairings remain in /userdata/system/.config/sunshine.
# SUNSHINE_DISPLAY=:0.0
# Optional persistent compatibility libraries, ahead of the existing library path:
# SUNSHINE_LIBRARY_PATH=/userdata/system/extra-libs
# SUNSHINE_APPIMAGE=/userdata/system/bin/sunshine-service-current
# SUNSHINE_LOGFILE=/userdata/system/logs/sunshine.log
